### =======================================================
### USUARIOS (Users)
### =======================================================

### Criar Usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Administrador",
  "email": "admin@helpdesk.com",
  "password": "123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Listar Usuarios
GET http://localhost:8080/users


### =======================================================
### ATIVOS DE TI (Assets) - CENARIOS DE SUCESSO
### =======================================================

### 1. Criar Ativo (POST /assets) -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NOTE-001",
  "type": "Notebook",
  "description": "Dell Latitude 3420 - Core i5 16GB",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 2. Criar Segundo Ativo para testes (POST /assets) -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "MON-001",
  "type": "Monitor",
  "description": "Dell 24 polegadas Full HD",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 3. Listar Todos os Ativos (GET /assets) -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/assets

### 4. Buscar Ativo por ID (GET /assets/{id}) -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/assets/1

### 5. Atualizar Ativo Completo (PUT /assets/{id}) -> 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8080/assets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NOTE-001",
  "type": "Notebook Corporativo",
  "description": "Dell Latitude 3420 - Atualizado para 32GB RAM",
  "status": "UNDER_MAINTENANCE"
}

### 6. Atualizar Somente Status do Ativo (PATCH /assets/{id}/status) -> 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:8080/assets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_USE"
}

### 7. Excluir Ativo (DELETE /assets/{id}) -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/assets/2


### =======================================================
### ATIVOS DE TI (Assets) - CENARIOS DE ERRO
### =======================================================

### Erro 1: Buscar por ID Inexistente (GET /assets/{id}) -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/assets/999

### Erro 2: Criar com Código Duplicado (POST /assets) -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NOTE-001",
  "type": "Notebook",
  "description": "Tentando recriar com codigo que ja existe",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### Erro 3: Atualizar usando Código de Outro Ativo (PUT /assets/{id}) -> 409 Conflict
PUT http://localhost:8080/assets/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NOTE-001",
  "type": "Monitor",
  "description": "Tentativa de colocar o codigo do ativo 1 no ativo 2",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### Erro 4: Campos Obrigatórios Ausentes (POST /assets) -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "type": "",
  "description": "Descricao sem codigo nem tipo nem status",
  "status": null
}

### Erro 5: Status Inválido no Enum (PATCH /assets/{id}/status) -> 400 Bad Request
PATCH http://localhost:8080/assets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "STATUS_QUE_NAO_EXISTE"
}

### Erro 6: Excluir ID Inexistente (DELETE /assets/{id}) -> 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/assets/999